window.products.push({"id":420092,"name":"Guzzini Look Chrome Cheese/Preserve/Sugar Server Bowl with Lid and Teaspoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YAZC+e+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make every moment of the day special with Guzzini—products designed to be used! This is the ideal multi-purpose container for any table's small essentials. Whether it's serving sugar with coffee, parmesan cheese with your favorite Italian meal, or jam for morning toast, this container does it all! Equipped with a teaspoon, consistently measure equal amounts with ease. The inner bowl is made from glass with the exterior being particularly thick for extra durability while the lid sits atop the jar to protect its contents. Made in Italy from glass and SAN-plastic, this piece is dishwasher safe and built to last. Measures 6-1/2 by 5 by 4-Inches. Since the inception of Fratelli Guzzini in 1912, innovation has been at the very core of every product design. Inspired by his personal experiences at home and abroad, Enrico Guzzini initially set out to relaunch an ancient craft by producing elegant ox horn items. Later, a younger Guzzini generation began to craft household items from Plexiglas. Reaching it’s next milestone in the 1960’s, Raimondo Guzzini began to create a more open approach to business with the introduction of moulded acrylics while focusing on creative design concepts. By the 1980’s Fratelli Guzzini began to shape into the company that it is known for today by introducing color and a creative incorporation of various materials like porcelain and glass. With many awards from all over the world, some of Guzzini’s collections are showcased at the Museum of Modern Art in New York as well as the Victoria and Albert Museum in London. Guzzini strives for the ideal combination of practicality and aesthetic appeal while a research team carefully considers the environmental cost. Accordingly, their products are durable enough to be used over and over again, but recyclable to prevent waste when it is time to get a new set of Guzzini products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YAZC+e+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guzzini","source_asin":"B002QFNRUC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002QFNRUC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002QFNRUC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420093,"name":"VHC Brands Whimsical Christmas Runner 13x48","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TMnW4T20L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the colorful candies and delicious sweets of the holiday season, we created the Whimsical Christmas Runner. Starting with a bright green burlap, the runner features a fun array of red, white and green buttons between the red rick rack and striped borders. The flannel lining adds a softness and durability to complement the fun look. Red tassels complete the look. Reverses to red, green, and white stripes. FEATURES Bright green burlap base fabric Bright green burlap base fabric Scattered red, white, and green buttons sectioned off by red rick rack Scattered red, white, and green buttons sectioned off by red rick rack Flannel lining Flannel lining Straight edge with .5\" striped binding with a red tassel in each corner Straight edge with .5\" striped binding with a red tassel in each corner Reverses to red, green, and white striped fabric Reverses to red, green, and white striped fabric Assorted fabrics: Machine stitched Assorted fabrics: Machine stitched SPECIFICATIONS Material: 100% cotton exclusive of embellishments Material: 100% cotton exclusive of embellishments Colors: bright green, crisp white, classic red Colors: bright green, crisp white, classic red Manufacturer Country: India Manufacturer Country: India Care: Hand wash separately in cold water. Do not wring. Lay flat to dry, out of direct sunlight. No chlorine bleach. Do not iron or tumble dry. Care: Hand wash separately in cold water. Do not wring. Lay flat to dry, out of direct sunlight. No chlorine bleach. Do not iron or tumble dry. SIZES AVAILABLE 13x48Weight: .5 lbDimensions: L13\"xW48\" 13x48 Weight: .5 lb Weight: .5 lb Dimensions: L13\"xW48\" Dimensions: L13\"xW48\" 13x36Weight: .4 lbDimensions: L13\"xW36\" 13x36 Weight: .4 lb Weight: .4 lb Dimensions: L13\"xW36\" Dimensions: L13\"xW36\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TMnW4T20L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B08KNVXSSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KNVXSSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KNVXSSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
