window.products.push({"id":420186,"name":"Dawn Ultra, Puff Glass And Dish, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v4AOJnRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make washing the dishes a breeze with the Dawn Ultra Puff Glassware and Dish Brush. This scrubber combines the longer-length design of a brush with a soft sponge head to keep your glasses, bottles, cups, plates, bowls, pots, pans, and more clean and spotless without scratching surfaces. The layered sponge head builds up bubbles and foam with just a drop of soap for a long-lasting lather, while the rounded shape easily cleans hard-to-reach places. The no-slip comfort grip handle provides a secure hold while washing the dishes, and it has an integrated hanging loop so you can hang the brush to dry after use. The modern design with bright blue and white color adds a touch of style to your kitchen sink. This sponge brush measures 11.1\" x 2.5\" x 2.5\" for convenient storage in drawers, cabinets, and under the sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v4AOJnRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dawn","source_asin":"B07NDY9QL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDY9QL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDY9QL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420187,"name":"BreakABud Premium Electric Herb Grinder with Pollen Catcher. USB-Rechargeable Stainless Steel with Forward and Reverse Grinding Action - Never Jams (B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U06t6pIrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Break A Bud is essential to getting the most out of your herb. Just like buying your first set of real kitchen knives or a piece of wall art that isn’t a movie poster, buying a good grinder is a rite of passage for people who take their herb seriously. Wooden and acrylic grinders are for amateurs, and what’s more, they aren’t safe! The wood or acrylic that flakes off during the grinding process can later end up in your lungs. That’s why BreakABud uses aluminum alloy. Aluminum will only melt at temperatures of over 660 degrees celsius, and boil at over 2,500 degrees. Manual or electric? For people suffering from arthritis, or other ailments, an electric grinder is a no-brainer. But why in any case would you cause yourself the pain of having to manually grind herb? Come on, this is the 21st century! BreakABud is also USB-rechargeable, so you won’t need to steal batteries from your remote control every time you want to grind up some herb. But most importantly, BreakABud doesn’t jam up. With our one of a kind bidirectional, jam detection response, BreakABud powers through the stickiest herb to create a fine, even grind. The choice is simple. You don’t need to throw away your old manual wooden grinder - you can hang on to it as a keepsake, but do give your mom her coffee grinder back, and get ready to join the electric grinder age with BreakABud -the first and last grinder you’ll ever use. Features and details Built to last. Built to last. BreakABud, not your bank account. Don’t get yourself into a jam, man. Don’t get yourself into a jam, man. BreakABud offers a bidirectional jam detection response. No more mess, no more stress. No more mess, no more stress. Keep your bud under wraps with a magnetic lid. Room to burn. Room to burn. BreakABud is portable, and comes with a soft carry case. Warning: Keep out of the reach of children. IMPORTANT: THIS GRINDER WORKS BEST WITH DRY HERB. IF YOUR HERB IS MOIST, YOU'LL WANT TO BREAK IT INTO SMALLER CHUNKS BEFORE GRINDING.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U06t6pIrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BreakABud","source_asin":"B07WQYKG6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WQYKG6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WQYKG6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
