window.products.push({"id":420565,"name":"Speakeasy Distillers - Glass Proofing Parrot with Alcohol Hyrdrometer Tester 0-200 Proof & Tralle, Alcoholmeter Made in Scotland, Home Brewing DIY Moo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F8wwg7CZL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Parrot allows the distiller to read proof of the run in real time. It is connected between condenser and collection container, allowing the distillate to flow through. The aim is to test the alcohol percentage of the distillate continuously, and let that be the guide to decide where to make the cuts. Fun fact: borosilicate glass is so resistant to chemicals, that it is even used to store nuclear waste. The boron in the glass makes it less soluble, preventing any unwanted materials from leaching into the glass, or the other way around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F8wwg7CZL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPEAKEASY","source_asin":"B089YCPTWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089YCPTWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089YCPTWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420566,"name":"Home Marketplace Oversized Stainless Steel Bread Box, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Vreig7NBL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"The countertop classic gets a modern makeover Home Marketplace Oversized Stainless Steel Bread Box features a generously sized interior perfect for storing all your baked goods from loaves to rolls to sweet treats. Stainless steel design with weighted lid adds sleek style, making this bread bin complement any kitchen decor from traditional to contemporary. Approx. 17 1/2\" W x 10 1/2\" D x 7\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Vreig7NBL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miles Kimball","source_asin":"B07G7JDK48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G7JDK48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G7JDK48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420567,"name":"KitchenAid Professional Fruit Slicer, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BQ0746D5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Try this KitchenAid Professional Fruit Slicer and you can slice your fruit in one easy motion. It is perfect for apples, pears and other fruits to make your pies, tarts or even a healthy snack. With its durable stainless cutting blade it slices easily through fruit to produce perfect wedges. It is available in Red or Black and is dishwasher safe. Amazon.com This fruit slicer cores and slices apples and pears into appealing wedges in just seconds. The simple gadget also greatly reduces the amount of time it takes to prepare fruits for pies or tarts, and is much easier to use than some of the more gimmicky coring/slicing contraptions out there. Equipped with a sharp stainless-steel cutting blade, the slicer fits over any apple with less than a 4-1/4-inch diameter and divides it into eight sections while simultaneously separating out the core. The slicer requires only one swift push downward to execute and a soft-grip rubber handles ensure that the slicer wont slip out of hands. The slicer has a durable plastic body that wont show stains, and is safe for cleaning in the dishwasher. KitchenAid offers a hassle-free replacement warranty on this slicer during the first year of ownership and a lifetime limited warranty on it thereafter. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BQ0746D5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B000684DM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000684DM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000684DM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420568,"name":"LED Fireplace TV Stand for 65 inch TV Entertainment Center, Modern Farmhouse Barn Door LED TV Console Media Table Cabinet with 3-Level Adjustable Shel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bd4oxO+XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Led Fireplace TV Stand & 2-IN-1 Design】The fireplace TV stand features blue led light will make your entertainment life more dynamic,make movie watching or play the game more enjoyable. You can put the fireplace in the cabinet to bring warmth to the cold winter and enjoy the 3D realistic flame effect in the summer. 【Ample Storage Space & Fit 65 inch TV】 The 60 inch media console with fireplace accommodate TVs up to 65”. It features 6 storage w/ 3-level adjustable and removable shelf in the middle providing sufficient storage space and privacy protection.Prismatic metal hinges and cubic bar on the barn door pulls make it more beautiful. Suitable for all the decor style and increase aesthetic for your living room. 【Selected Material & Metal Legs】Thickened wood materials are used to make this oak modern entertainment center, especially for top and bottom to ensure its firmness and sturdiness. It features metal base instead of cheap wood for long-lasting construction and using. Size: 58\"L x15.7\"W x28\"H. Top weight limit: 260lbs. 【Adjustable Temperature & Energy Savings】The ETL certified fire place is equipped with overheat protection for safer use.Designed with 5 flame brightness and adjustable temperature from 65℉ to 95℉. Also has 2 heating mode(750W or 1400W) perform adjustable power capacity accordingly for both warm and energy-saving purposes.Heats rooms up to 400 sq.ft. 【Led TV Console】The farmhouse barn door tv cabinet comes with 13.1ft blue LED lights with power of 5V,30W, for creating a beautiful atmosphere and enhancing your living room.CE and ROHS certification are listed to provide you with a safe and healthy living environment. 【Easy Installation & 2 Packages】The television stands and fireplace insert are shipped separately, so you may receive two packages at different times.With detailed instruction, the tv console is easy to assemble.And its smooth waterproof surface is effortless to clean, facilitating your daily cleaning work. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bd4oxO+XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAMPAT","source_asin":"B0B42F6FBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B42F6FBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B42F6FBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
