window.products.push({"id":420671,"name":"Lahome Coasters for Drinks, Absorbent Ceramic Stone Coaster with Cork Base, Tabletop Protection for Kinds of Cups, Mugs, Room Decorations Housewarming","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bdz7qMK+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you drink iced beverage or water, the appearance of water rings or marks on tabletop is an annoying trouble. Trust us, Lahome coaster could help you get rid of this! A set of coaster like this can not only help protect your tabletop, but provide a touch of aesthetics to your kitchen or dinning room. Tiny little accessories make your life easier! What's in the box? 4 Coasters Features: -Great at absorbing moisture, drops from cold drinks within 15 seconds.-Anti-skid cork backing prevents the coasters from sliding and helps protect your table or countertop from scratches, spilling and drops.-The printed surface does not fade and is heat resistant.-Durable natural ceramic stone.-Great as holiday & housewarming gift, neutral home decor Clean Instruction: -To avoid stains, we recommend rinsing the coaster immediately if coffee or dark drink splashed on it, then wipe with a cloth and air dry. -Make sure the coasters are clean and dry before stocking them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bdz7qMK+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lahome","source_asin":"B097JLPGT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JLPGT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JLPGT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
