window.products.push({"id":420810,"name":"16 ounce Mason Jar Hand-Poured Soy Candle - Blue Spruce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D56+X95kL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand poured small batch pure soy candle. Ever hike out and cut your own Christmas Tree? With my Blue Spruce, you'll feel like you did just that. More complex than a typical Frasier or Douglas Fir, it's got a punchy, bright citrus note that is really pleasing. Capture the spirit of the holidays with this strong, true, and enchanting scent. We love this fragrance and think you will too. This fragrance oil is infused with natural cedarwood and pine essential oils. 16 oz mason jar with rustic bronze lid I pour the best soy wax product available today. It's 100% vegetable, made with pure, all-natural soybean oil using soy beans that are farm-grown in the U.S. This wax is completely free of paraffin product, which is derived from refined crude oil. I use a flat, coreless cotton wick that is braided with thin paper filaments. These filaments aid in reducing soot and mushrooming at the end of the wick during burning. Each wick is primed with soy wax as well, not paraffin, for a clean burn. I use only premium-grade fragrance oils. Soy Candle Info: -all natural soy wax -infused with pure essential oils and premium phthalate free fragrances -re-usable 16 oz mason jar 5\" Height 3\" Diameter -burns cleanly and slowly 85-100 hour burn time -cotton wicked -100% dye free -lead free **Burning Instructions** Trim wick to 1/4\" before lighting Keep burn pool free of foreign objects Let wax melt completely to edge before extinguishing. This will discourage tunneling giving the candle the longest life possible. Do not burn for more than 4 hours at a time Clean burning, soy candles do not emit toxins or chemicals and are less likely to trigger allergies. Naturally biodegradable and water-soluble, soy wax spills are easy to clean up and do not leave a chemical film on the candle jar. True Soy Wax is prone to cosmetic imperfections, this just shows its pure soy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D56+X95kL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B019BC088G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019BC088G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019BC088G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
