window.products.push({"id":420817,"name":"BlueHills Premium Memory Foam Neck Travel Twist Airplane Pillow in Super Soft Velvet Cover & Travel Accessories in Carry case Bag with Hand Luggage Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ghywJ5pwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flexible shape for comfort with adjustable size option: The ultra-comfortable BlueHills neck pillow uses premium grade memory foam to bend into any possible shape, allowing you to maximize your personal comfort by changing the shape of the pillow. This pillow can be used for your head, neck, back, or legs depending on the position, and can be shaped into a U for use while travelling in a car, boat, train, or airplane. The length of the neck pillow is 25.5 inches and the diameter are 4 inches. Washable premium soft velvet outer cover: Our flexible memory foam neck pillow is covered with a removable, machine washable premium quality velvet cover so you can always keep it clean and fresh for your next adventure. The front of the pillow includes buttons you can use to close the ends of the pillow together and be used as a neck pillow, providing a high degree of luxury while sleeping in a sitting position. The two buttons provide the flexibility of adjusting the closure. Bonus1: travel friendly versatile velvet carry case with hand luggage belt –This BlueHills product has a custom design soft carry case with hand luggage belt that other neck pillows in the market don’t have. The included travel case allows the pillow to be attached to a carryon luggage or be carried with the strap while you are travelling, allowing you to take the pillow anywhere you go easily. This Zipper Carrying Case/Pouch with hand-luggage belt – measures 13 inches X 8.5 inches Bonuses 3 & 4 – velvet drawstring bag and premium soft eye mask: This package comes up a matching drawstring bag measures 5.5 X 4.5 inches. Also, a very soft premium big sized travel eye mask for sleep Bonuses 5 & 6 - backpack clip and ear plugs included in the package: With the backpack clip / carabiner, you can clip this neck pillow to any backpack or to any other luggage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ghywJ5pwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueHills","source_asin":"B07QZDSJ8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZDSJ8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QZDSJ8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420818,"name":"Visit Lahaina - Maui, Hawaii - Inter-Island Steam Navigation Company - Front Street - Vintage Hawaiian Travel Poster by Kerne Erickson - Master Art Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LDp23z01L._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Kerne Erickson - For over 30 years, award-winning artist Kerne Erickson’s retro-style travel posters have been taking viewers ‘on location’ to popular destinations around the globe. Inspired by vintage vacation photos, brochures and other graphics, his depictions are painstakingly researched and meticulously depicted for historical accuracy as well as irresistible nostalgia. At a time when sterile, computer-generated art has become popular, it’s refreshing to see an artist like Kerne who can work his way from a well composed pencil drawing, through transparent layers of under painting, building depth and tonality until finally adding the finishing touches that bring the work into focus. His work is a perfect blend of traditional technique and modern painting mediums. Erickson, a graduate of Los Angeles Art Center College, worked for years as a freelance graphic artist on client commissions which served to develop his distinctive style. He is now a freelance artist working at his home in Orange County, California where he lives with his family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LDp23z01L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B01MFDSNEL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MFDSNEL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MFDSNEL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
