window.products.push({"id":420856,"name":"Rotary Cheese Grater Kitchen Shredder with Enlarge Veggie Entrance Round Vegetable Mandoline Slicer Grater for Nuts, Vegetable, Chocolate, Chesse - 3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wCptjK4CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SAFETY IS OUR FIRST CONSIDERATION - Easily using our rotary cheese grater without touching blades. The blade barrel part is composed of two identical high-quality stainless steel blades and a plastic barrel, it has three kinds of blades, a total of 6 blades. Other parts of our grater are made from food grade BPA free plastic. No electricity needed, You can simply clean the grater under running water, it’s also dishwasher safe. ✏Be careful when replacing blades. SIMPLE & SAVING TIME - With our elegant cheese grater, cooking preparation will be super easy and efficient. Rotating 1 circle means cutting serval times. This vegetable slicer helps your food preparation faster and less effort. Only 3 steps, you can finish assembling. No need to take too much time to learn how to use, then you can cut food into pieces what you want. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL ROTARY GRATER - Choose our 3 in 1 practical grater for kitchen to replace outdated single function gadget. With 3 kinds of blades, you can easily finish slicing, shredding and grinding. It’s suitable for grating cheese, carrot, cucumber, potato, zucchini, biscuits, chocolate, broccoli, nuts, ice, etc. ✏Juicy foods such as onions are not recommended. ENLARGE VEGGIE ENTRANCE DESIGN - The size of the veggie entrance has been upgraded to 3.34”*4.01”, which allows users to put in larger whole ingredients. To be more stable while using, we designed a strong suction base for the product. When placed on a smooth and clean tabletop, just twist of the locking lever, it can be firmly fixed on the tabletop. THOUGHTFUL GIFT CHOICE - Rotary Cheese Grater is an ideal gift for cooking lovers, family or friends. We believe it will not disappoint any user. Plus, we offer 100% purchase satisfaction and timely technical support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wCptjK4CL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Badelite","source_asin":"B0BV2H5NHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV2H5NHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV2H5NHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":420857,"name":"M&R Tortilla Warmer 10\" - THE Best and Quickest Bread Warmer. Insulated Cotton Fabric Pouch, Keeps Warm for One Hour After Just 45 Seconds in the Micr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514ZetU+3YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nobody likes cold tortillas! The M&R 100% cloth tortilla warmer is both a festive and decorative presentation piece for your next fiesta. Tortilla warmers are essential to any Mexican kitchen, which is used to keep tortillas hot and fresh for up to one hour. Our tortilla warmer features an insulated pouch for the tortillas. Simply load the tortillas directly into the warmer, and place the unit into the microwave for approximately 60 seconds, which heats up the tortillas to perfection and allows them to remain hot and fresh for up to one hour. The perforated, food-safe PVC barrier inside the pouch allows the moisture to escape slowly, preventing sweating from inside the pouch. Our tortilla warmer is not only meant for tortillas! You can use it for pita bread, quesadillas, waffles, bread rolls, and even pancakes. The warmer is also easy to hand or machine wash and dries quickly. What are you waiting for? Let’s make your next dinner a fiesta! M&R Tortilla Warmer Features: KEEP TORTILLAS HOT KEEP TORTILLAS HOT HOLDS UP TO 10 TORTILLAS HOLDS UP TO 10 TORTILLAS PERFECT 10” SIZE PERFECT 10” SIZE EASY TO CLEAN EASY TO CLEAN MICROWAVE SAFE MICROWAVE SAFE WARM ANY BREAD WARM ANY BREAD Cleaning Instructions Cleaning our tortilla warmer is easy, simply follow the instructions below: Cleaning our tortilla warmer is easy, simply follow the instructions below: Remove any contents inside the warmer Remove any contents inside the warmer Invert from pulling on the inside Invert from pulling on the inside Hand or Machine wash the warmer from the inside Hand or Machine wash the warmer from the inside Let the warmer sit and air dry Let the warmer sit and air dry Ready for use! Ready for use! Lifetime Warranty Guaranteed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514ZetU+3YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M&R","source_asin":"B01NCKVP4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCKVP4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCKVP4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
