window.products.push({"id":420945,"name":"Full Fit Able Wine Chiller Bucket - Elegant Stainless Steel Wine and Champagne Bucket for 750ml - Double Walled Insulated Wine Cooler with Gift Box (S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VNoOjsBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description This wine chiller bucket is a stylish and functional method to keep your wine chilled. It is ideal to use for many occasions, indoor or outdoor, such as picnics, special dinners, romantic evenings, birthdays, and holidays. A perfect centerpiece for dinner parties and entertaining giving your home a restaurant feel. With this wine aerator pourer any wine-drinking experience is taken to another level. Your wine will be aerated with a sense of elegance and style, from bottle to glass. It enhances the wine bouquet and flavour instantly. A wine aerator is a must-have item. This package is a perfect gift idea for wine lovers and enthusiasts for Birthdays, Thanksgiving, Christmas, or other special occasions. Characteristics: -Wine chiller bucket Easy and convenient to use and clean. Elegant and beautiful design that matches the decor of any home, office, bar, and party. Double-wall construction that insulates your drink from ambient room temperature and prevents drips and condensation. Product material: Stainless Steel Product dimensions: 7.48 inches tall and 4.33 inches diameter suitable for 750 ml bottles -Wine aerator pourer Innovative design that prevent leaks, drops and fits to any bottles. Bernoulli Effect Bubbles show appropriate aeration – as wine is dispensed. Exceptional air Holes draw in the oxygen to aerate the wine during pouring. Easy to use and clean. Package Include: Cooler Bucket x 1, Aerator Wine Pourer x 1, Bo 1 “Drink good wine with good food in good company is one of life’s most civilized pleasures.” Michael Broadbent","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VNoOjsBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Full Fit Able","source_asin":"B09DL5QXZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DL5QXZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DL5QXZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
