window.products.push({"id":420997,"name":"Flies Be Gone Monster Soda Bottle Fly Trap (2 Pack) Reusable, 100% Non-Toxic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-IhsmPDlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Flies are dangerous. In addition to being carriers of filth, flies may aid in the transmission of many harmful human diseases.Unfortunately, pesticides used to control fly populations can often be more dangerous than the insects themselves. If improperly used, pesticides have been linked with multiple medical problems. No one likes flies… But flies love us. Flies Be Gone has developed products to attract flies away from your protected area without the use of poisons. Flies Be Gone KM34 Bait is a superior non-toxic solution designed to lure the flies into the trap without the dangers that pesticides pose, and at only a fraction of the cost. Once flies have entered a building, half of the battle is already lost. The time to stop flies is while they are still outside. Flies Be Gone is an effective perimeter defense, trapping the flies outside before they overwhelm the indoor areas. Using the exclusive KM34 formula, Flies Be Gone is perfect for reducing fly populations in high-infestation areas. The formulation is like a gourmet fly meal, attracting flies away from your patio, BBQ, outdoor eating area, pool, terrace. Good in commercial settings, restaurant entrances, dumpster areas, loading docks. Also perfect for feed lots, poultry farms, dairy farms, stables, kennels and any outdoor areas where flies are a problem. “THE MONSTER” Soda Bottle Fly Trap will catch flies by the liter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-IhsmPDlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flies Be Gone","source_asin":"B074THQZ4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-420997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074THQZ4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074THQZ4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
